<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets warrants on HKR Int'l.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets warrants on HKR Int'l.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd is issuing 250 million American style call warrants on shares of HKR International Ltd, a company official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$9.38	PREMIUM	 11.96 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.232     GEARING	 4.5X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  06.NOV.97    MIN EXER LOT  8,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	 2 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE	  HK$10.45</p>
<p> NOTE		  GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
